senses.gloss:
अच्युत + .{@-तः@}
—1 N. of Viṣṇu; of the Almighty Being;
[]
 यस्मान्न च्युतपूर्वोऽहमच्युतस्तेन कर्मणा Bhāg.
—2 गच्छाम्यच्युतदशनेन K. P. 5. (where अ˚ also means ‘one who is firm, does not yield to passions’
)
—3 N. of a plant, Morinda Tinctoria. (Mar. बारातोंडी, शिर्दोली).
—4 A sort of poetical composition containing 12 cantos.
